WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,030
Dad holds baby

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:03,870
Dad, hold the baby

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,080
I'm not your dad

4
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,520
I'm really not your dad

5
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:08,880
I'm only twenty-one

6
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,240
Love is not there yet

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:22,860
How can Mr. Yun give birth to a child when he is so young?

8
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:25,460
So pitiful, yes, yes, please give me a hug

9
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:32,600
I cried so much that I wanted to breastfeed and hug my uncle.

10
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:37,000
Dad holds the baby well

11
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,280
Dad holds baby, holds baby

12
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:42,150
I'm going to the police station

13
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:43,910
For cooperation issues, I asked Feng Lai to come up with a plan.

14
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:48,020
Tell your dad not to go to the police station

15
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:49,460
Go to the hospital for parent-child laying

16
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:52,140
Prove that you are your father's baby, tell him now

17
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,700
You came back from a parallel world

18
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:59,470
Did you see it glow red or not?

19
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:03,820
He's not Ultraman, so how can he shine as a benefactor?

20
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:05,260
The jellyfish tribe has begun

21
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:07,060
Decipher your experience of parallel time and space

22
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:09,380
Make sure you are safe in this world

23
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:10,860
Leave it to me

24
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:13,660
Just worry about it

25
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:17,220
You are that lump in the sea

26
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,220
Mindless stuff

27
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:22,720
I want to be caught doing rigor

28
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:24,640
Our race of hundreds of millions of years will be exterminated
